OL,3,AMan attacked by tiger at Yorkshire
OL,4,AWildlife Park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been seriously injured after
OL,7,Fbeing attacked by a tiger at Yorkshire
OL,8,FWildlife Park, police have said.
OL,10,FSouth Yorkshire Police said it was
OL,11,Fcalled at 13:35 BST to reports of a man
OL,12,Fentering the tiger enclosure at the
OL,13,Fattraction near Doncaster.
OL,15,FIn a statement posted on its website,
OL,16,Fthe park said its emergency response
OL,17,Fprocedures had been "immediately
OL,18,Factivated" and it was "working closely
OL,19,Fwith the authorities to ascertain
OL,20,Fexactly what happened".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
